OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused denies friend tried
OL,4,Ato help him
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who fatally punched a pub owner
OL,7,Fhas denied another member of his group
OL,8,Ftried to help him evade police in the
OL,9,Fhours after the attack.
OL,11,FStafford Crown Court heard Billy
OL,12,FAllison, 36, fled the Ricco and Loren
OL,13,Fbar in Lichfield after punching
OL,14,F44-year-old Matthew O'Gara, who later
OL,15,Fdied from his injuries, and another
OL,16,Fman, Adam Cooper, 62.
OL,18,FAllison was later seen swapping shirts
OL,19,Fwith another man, Ben Cullen, before
OL,20,Fthe pair went to the hotel where Cullen
OL,21,Fwas staying.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
