OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused denies friend tried
OL,4,Ato help him
OL,5,
OL,6,FAllison, of Cropthorne Road in Shirley,
OL,7,FSolihull, denies O'Gara's murder and
OL,8,Fsection 18 grievous bodily harm with
OL,9,Fintent to Cooper, but admits
OL,10,Falternative charges of manslaughter and
OL,11,Finflicting grievous bodily harm.
